{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/avanti","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":844,"crm_id":null,"search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Avanti","slug":"avanti","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Damac Properties","price":1058000,"display_price":"1.058M","lattitude":25.1897158,"longitude":55.2647212176318,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Located in Business Bay, Avanti by Damac offers you stunning studios, <strong>1, 2, 3 bedroom apartments.</strong> Close to the most exciting attractions of the city, including the Burj Khalifa and the Dubai Mall, Avanti is a 15-storey tower with state-of-the-art amenities for the residents.&nbsp;</p><p>These homes come with a beautifully fitted kitchen, complete with white goods and appliances. Residents can enjoy the sauna and steam room, while the children have a dedicated play area for them. Not just that, you also have large balconies in your homes as well as green areas and water bodies like lakes and fountains located close by.</p><p>You will also have access to hospitals and schools close to the tower. This is the perfect investment opportunity. As mentioned, Avanti is located close to the Burj Khalifa, as well as Jumeirah Beach, Dubai International Financial Centre, Dubai World Trade Centre and the Dubai International Airport. You will also be in proximity to the famous Dubai Fountains, as well as the iconic Burj area.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/avanti_feature_7455046fcb.jpg","hash":"avanti_feature_7455046fcb","name":"Avanti"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/avanti_banner_a6ee6ce44f.jpg","hash":"avanti_banner_a6ee6ce44f","name":"Avanti"},"media_images":[{"url":"